      <div class="bxa-perk"><span class="bxa-pi"><i class="ph-duotone ph-headset"></i></span><div><b>Priority support</b><span>Answers from the team that wrote the runtime.</span></div></div>
      <div class="bxa-perk"><span class="bxa-pi"><i class="ph-duotone ph-wrench"></i></span><div><b>Custom development</b><span>Agents, tools, gateways and integrations built to your brief.</span></div></div>
      <div class="bxa-perk"><span class="bxa-pi"><i class="ph-duotone ph-graduation-cap"></i></span><div><b>Training and review</b><span>Get your team productive and your design checked.</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="bxa-wrap">
  <div class="bxa-final bxa-rv">
    <h2>Describe the agent.<br><span class="bxa-grad">Let the folders do the rest.</span></h2>
    <div class="bxa-cta"><a class="bxa-btn bxa-btn-primary" href="##start">Get started <i class="ph-duotone ph-arrow-up-right"></i></a><a class="bxa-btn bxa-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/ortus-boxlang/bx-agents">Star on GitHub</a></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
